freeram (2.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Reject invalid command-line options with clear errors.
  * Allow dry-run and statistics modes without root privileges.
  * Validate procfs memory/cache interfaces and fail cleanly on cache errors.
  * Improve history and activity-log diagnostics.
  * Harden installer/uninstaller and install the man page.
  * Add regression tests and GitHub Actions CI.
  * Rewrite safety, automation, and troubleshooting documentation.

 -- mrprohack <mrprohack@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 08:00:00 +0000

freeram (2.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Added cross-distribution Linux support.
  * Added silent, test, and statistics modes.
  * Added history tracking, install/uninstall scripts, man page, examples,
    Debian packaging files, and a test suite.

 -- mrprohack <mrprohack@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 04 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
